  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your unique victory performance gets the crowd on your side.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Masterful Display<sup>UC</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose the effects of any two mythic performance feats you have, or any three performance feats. When you make a performance combat check, you gain the benefits of those feats, but you only gain a +2 on the performance combat check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc224\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
